      "writtenOn": "2021-10-12T14:53:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You\u0027ll copy only one byte from data to value. Do you need to cast data to (uint32_t)? What does battparam command print? Callers are expecting uint32_t to be returned. If we\u0027re returning only a uint32_t, why are we reading whole 11-byte string? This function is copied in multiple boards. It looks bizarre to me.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 693,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 693,
        "endChar": 14
      },
      "revId": "04872713abedf86df14b9392ee89b4601d86381d",
