        "id": 1503037
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-13T10:09:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Battery vendor param value is a string, such as \"W1SZ14T009B\", it only by block read, a single register can\u0027t read, so we need to define all the memory(11 byte) to hold its value.\n`ectool batteryParam get \u003creg\u003e` cmd read a register string. I think since uint32_t can\u0027t return all strings, so returns a register string.",
      "parentUuid": "a6c5cacb_053af04d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 693,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 693,
        "endChar": 14
      },
      "revId": "04872713abedf86df14b9392ee89b4601d86381d",
