        "id": 1106949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-13T14:19:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, battery_get_vendor_param (or EC_CMD_BATTERY_VENDOR_PARAM) needs to be called 11 times because we\u0027re returning only one character at a time. And every time it\u0027s called buffered, a whole string is buffered (and mostly wasted). That\u0027s very inefficient...\n\nWe should make battery_get_vendor_param (and EC_CMD_BATTERY_VENDOR_PARAM) return a whole string.",
